d immediately to \\\"Showing 2 of 8 venues\\\". Clearing search restored full list to 8 venues. Real-time updates confirmed without separate submit action needed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Opened wedding details form with Guest Count showing -50. Changed the value to 300 in the form. Clicked Cancel button. Form closed and Guest Count on dashboard remained at \\\"-50\\\", confirming the cancelled draft was discarded and previous state was preserved.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Dashboard displays couple names (Jack & Jennifer), formatted wedding date (Jun 15, 2026), budget ($0), guest count (-50), planning progress (0%), and previews of saved venues (2 saved), vendors (2 saved), and checklists (2 saved).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Venues display name (e.g., \\\"Rosewood Garden Estate\\\"), location (Napa Valley, CA), category (Garden), price range (Luxury $$$), rating (4.9), and summary description. Vendors display name (e.g., \\\"Eternal Moments Photography\\\"), location (Los Angeles, CA), service type (Photography), price range (Luxury $$$), rating (4.9), description, and specialties (Candid Shots, Drone Photography, Same-Day Edits).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Checklists page shows 6 categories: Planning, Ceremony, Reception, Attire, Honeymoon. \\\"12+ Months Before\\\" checklist has 6 tasks with titles and explanatory guidance: \\\"Set a budget\\\" (Determine your total wedding budget...), \\\"Choose a wedding date\\\" (Consider season, availability...), \\\"Book your venue\\\" (Popular venues book up quickly...), \\\"Start your guest list\\\" (Create a preliminary list...), \\\"Hire a wedding planner\\\" (If desired...), \\\"Book photographer & videographer\\\" (To